{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022082925649-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022085622\"/><p>鳴琴路有兩巴士相撞。</p><p>屯門發生交通意外。今日(22日)早上8時15分，兩輛巴士沿鳴琴路往良景邨方向行駛，至山景邨對開時意外相撞，據報兩車上共有8人受輕傷，多輛救護車奉召到場將傷者送院治理，意外原因有待警員調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:11.545704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:29:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:57:50.587873+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:17:57.120579+00:00","content_hash":"4442d7d02402ec54fea8cf4f495b1c48c83e3e111f171b4a2b2db6e3f38edf32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}